[D Quests for Scarlet Monastery - Armory \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 31-42 Scarlet Monastery Armory]
[NX 31-42 Scarlet Monastery Cathedral]

-- Left out: 1049, 1050, 1160 and 1113 Hearts of Zeal (Library guide; Hearts of Zeal drops in every wing), 1051 (Graveyard guide), 1951 Rituals of Power (Mage chain from Dustwallow, book is in the Library, verified=false in Dungeon Quest Atlas), 6141 Brother Anton (optional breadcrumb from Stormwind).
-- The Armory door needs The Scarlet Key from Arcanist Doan's chamber in the Library. Both kill quests end in the Cathedral guide.

