[A Alliance] Follow the Darkshore road south into Ashenvale [G41,40 Darkshore][G44,58 Darkshore][G44,76 Darkshore][G43,92 Darkshore] \\ Shadowclaw, Lady Moongazer and Carnivous (elites, level 13-17) roam near the road.
[A Alliance] Follow the Ashenvale road past Astranaar to Talondeep Path [G28,14 Ashenvale][G27,36 Ashenvale][G35,48 Ashenvale][G39,61 Ashenvale][G42.5,71 Ashenvale] \\ Ashenvale mobs reach the mid 30s on the way; the Mist Howler (elite, level 22) roams the north road.
[A Alliance] Go through Talondeep Path and down the east side of Stonetalon [G78,42 Stonetalon Mountains][G79.5,60 Stonetalon Mountains][G84.2,72 Stonetalon Mountains][G81,78.5 Stonetalon Mountains][G74.4,85.7 Stonetalon Mountains][G82,96 Stonetalon Mountains] \\ Grimtotem camps lie off the road: stay on it.
[A Alliance] Follow the road west along the Charred Vale's south edge into Desolace [G64.6,96.9 Stonetalon Mountains][G47.3,98.8 Stonetalon Mountains][G63.7,25.1 Desolace] \\ A Dark Rider (level 41) patrols this road and Giggler (elite, level 34) roams close by.
[A Alliance] Go north up the path to Nijel's Point and get the flight path from Baritanas Skyriver [P Nijel's Point] [G64.7,10.4 Desolace]
[A Alliance] Brother Anton gives [QA261 Down the Scarlet Path] [G66.5,7.9 Desolace] \\ Needs level 34.
[A Alliance] Back down to the road [G64.7,10.4 Desolace][G63.7,25.1 Desolace]
[A Alliance] Follow the road south-west [G52,40 Desolace] [OC]
[A Alliance] South past the Kodo Graveyard *(Hissperak, elite, level 37, may roam near)* [G50,60 Desolace] [OC]
[A Alliance] South-east [G58,73 Desolace][G60,80 Desolace] [OC] \\ Scorpashi, Mage Hunters and Burning Blade camps (level 37-39) sit beside the way; Lord Azrethoc (elite, level 40) is to the west.
[A Alliance] Kill 30 Undead Ravagers (level 37-38) in the south-east of Desolace [QC261 Down the Scarlet Path] [G64.0,81.5 Desolace][G62,88 Desolace] \\ They often come in groups. Dread Rippers (39-40), Magram Necromancers (42-43) and Magram Necrokhan (elite, level 45) are close by; Outcast Necromancers (39-40) to the south.
