[A Alliance] Turn north on the road to the monastery [G81.6,39.6 Tirisfal Glades] [OC]

Go into the monastery courtyard *(Scarlet elites, level 29-31, guard it)* [G82.6,33.8 Tirisfal Glades]
The Armory is the locked door on the left side of the main building; open it with The Scarlet Key [G85.7,31.9 Tirisfal Glades]

Inside the Armory:
[A Horde] Kill Herod, the Scarlet Champion, in the Hall of Champions [QC1048,3 Into The Scarlet Monastery] \\ A wave of Scarlet Trainees rushes in when he dies.
[A Alliance] Kill Herod, the Scarlet Champion, in the Hall of Champions [QC1053,3 In the Name of the Light] \\ A wave of Scarlet Trainees rushes in when he dies.
